{'symbol': 'AWK', 'date': '2023-06-14 11:00:00', 'title': 'AMERICAN WATER ANNOUNCES INAUGURAL CLASS OF INCLUSION AND DIVERSITY SCHOLARSHIP RECIPIENTS', 'text': "CAMDEN, N.J.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--AMERICAN WATER (NYSE: AWK), THE LARGEST PUBLICLY TRADED U.S. WATER AND WASTEWATER UTILITY COMPANY, TODAY ANNOUNCED THE RECIPIENTS OF THE 2023 INCLUSION AND DIVERSITY (“I&D”) SCHOLARSHIP PROGRAM. AWARDS TOTALING $100,000 WERE DISTRIBUTED NATIONWIDE TO TEN STUDENTS CONTINUING THEIR EDUCATION IN A NON-MEDICAL STEM OR BUSINESS-RELATED FIELD AT A HISPANIC SERVING INSTITUTION (HSI) OR A HISTORICALLY BLACK COLLEGE OR UNIVERSITY (HBCU) WITHIN AMERICA WATER'S NATIONAL."}